Z||000000||NIFE_[Dave]||06-11-2001||11:47 AM||||On July 1st, We are having a Memorabilia and Parts Swap Meet. This is your chance to sell those "extra" parts, literature, manuals, or whatever you have. You will also have an opportunity to buy much-needed parts or some rare Fiero memorabilia. The meet will be held in Lisle, IL. from Noon until 3pm.<P>Below is a link with a map and you can get the driving directions.<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.expedia.com/pub/agent.dll?qscr=mrdr&lats1=41.781082&lons1=-88.059087&alts1=25&ofsx=0.000000&ofsy=0.000000&strt1=5801+Westview+Ln&city1=Lisle&stnm1=IL&sthd1=IL&zipc1=6053" TARGET=_blank>http://www.expedia.com/pub/agent.dll?qscr=mrdr&lats1=41.781082&lons1=-88.059087&alts1=25&ofsx=0.000000&ofsy=0.000000&strt1=5801+Westview+Ln&city1=Lisle&stnm1=IL&sthd1=IL&zipc1=6053</A>  2&rtbl=1&wpst1=0&regn1=0&cnty1=4&fmap=1&tpid=1&dchg=&zz=992274718650<BR>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nife_logo1.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fierofocus.com" TARGET=_blank>N.I.F.E. Website</A><P><p>[This message has been edited by NIFE_[Dave] (edited 06-11-2001).]||||reg||2
