Z||000002||NIFE [PaulV]||06-12-2001||09:35 PM||||[B]I would like to renew my NIFE membership and see what the club offers for T-Shirts and stuff. Also, anyway of purchasing back issues of the newsletters?<P><BR>Renewal is $20.00. You will get all the issues for 2001, plus a order list for club "stuff". Back issues are available for $1.00 ea.  with renewal. 6 per year were printed. Have about 2-3 years back issues available.<BR>Renewal check to :<BR>NIFE<BR>P Vargyas<BR>2600 Longview Dr<BR>Lisle, IL. 60532||||reg||1
